{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7502c304a3a96f72076363f752243017a0223f2b5fe196b6ff877d0456eb07b8",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_b:2_4_047_02_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a26710aae7a92e39afcce99334723c49b6b7b60d0bccd2695afd0dfcbedcb760",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー？\n昨天的活动辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_b:2_4_047_02_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36eb16b70d7a66cf07174917bad59b2d137788fa7bf94bf41da1690868943179",
      "text": "领回来的道具，我立刻摆在房间里装饰起来了。\n那东西做工真好啊，看一整天都看不腻。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_b:2_4_047_02_09_b:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5007c0b7ef823546e563dc27a3ab38f01157f42856cc7e97ee1a0dbeb13c1695",
      "text": "感受到了讲究之处！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_b:2_4_047_02_09_b:cmd-000011:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ece5484643c0980c59a1a61fe6648924999c12e33f763b3a74430ab024365ac2",
      "text": "感受到了热情！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_b:2_4_047_02_09_b:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8be4d35ebb88335eacc610256147c44385dcdc0e872d993f5627d6acee4ea5dd",
      "text": "嗯，我也这么想。\n能感受到制作者倾注的热情呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_b:2_4_047_02_09_b:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b76a9bf28d03e63263a3696cfee600a3015a1f7ef5277bb6dcaecfacf44a1ecc",
      "text": "所以为了让观众席也能看清那把枪，\n我在持枪姿势上下了不少功夫。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_b:2_4_047_02_09_b:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:966618a3a2dbb36c9b72ab857a50827302cc22856b726c72147e205be826eb61",
      "text": "嘛，不过那种事也算自我满足吧。\n哪怕只要有一个人注意到了，也算没白费。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_b:2_4_047_02_09_b:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd8a3801d64acf3edd0cbea13b5c1034c82a64580589760d837fbdbcd730dfc6",
      "text": "大家肯定\n都注意到了哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_b:2_4_047_02_09_b:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9717d218ab8fbc2969ff29e3270f0e2f1ec01a6e39d0a218b423987d20016c1",
      "text": "听你的语气，难道你注意到了？\n嘿～挺能干的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_b:2_4_047_02_09_b:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02e65fde6eb7111da32324774230e9f24c6a40ccb2037776cf834ce1b08154f1",
      "text": "算了，身为我的制作人，这也算理所当然吧。\n……那就明天见啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
